        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#232F3E;" value="Legend / notes" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="300" x="856" y="587" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_body" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontColor=#3B4A57;" value="• Phases run in order; each phase consumes the previous phase&#39;s output (strict DAG).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• In Claude Code (Agent tool available), Research (4), Map (2+fan-out), and&lt;br&gt;  Recommended Guidance (3 families) fan out to parallel sub-agents; other&lt;br&gt;  clients run sequentially.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Default framework is CCMv4; NIST 800-53 / CIS / ISO 27001 available via&lt;br&gt;  --framework, plus custom frameworks anchored to CCMv4 guidance." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="244" width="690" x="856" y="617" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="meta" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#93A1AF;" value="Service Onboarding Accelerator · Pipeline flow · v3 (7-phase)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="980" x="1660" y="1027" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
